1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,500
钱包只知道怎么付款，却不知道这笔钱该不该付。
A wallet knows how to pay, but not whether it should.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:18,500
当 AI 开始自己花钱，它需要财务、采购和会计。这就是 Agent Treasury。
When AI starts spending, it needs finance, procurement, and accounting. This is Agent Treasury.

3
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:30,000
它不是新钱包，也不只服务于 x402，而是安装在 AI 里的 Treasury Skill。
It is not another wallet or an x402-only tool. It is a Treasury Skill installed into AI.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:43,000
用户设置采购偏好、自动支付上限、单笔上限，以及每天和每月的预算。
Set procurement preferences, approval limits, and daily and monthly budgets.

5
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:50,500
钱包继续保管资产和签名，Agent Treasury 不接触私钥。
The wallet keeps custody and signing. Agent Treasury never handles private keys.

6
00:00:50,500 --> 00:01:00,500
用户仍然可以自然地对 AI 说：帮我获取一份最新的市场数据。
The user simply asks the AI: Get me the latest market data.

7
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:15,500
Treasury 比较供应商、检查价格、验证风险和支付地址，再按照用户策略作出决定。
Treasury compares vendors, checks price and risk, then applies the user's policy.

8
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:28,000
低风险且在自动支付上限内的采购会自动完成，只在右下角显示简洁结果。
Low-risk purchases within the auto-pay limit complete automatically with a concise result notification.

9
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:42,500
超过自动支付权限时，中央审批卡会显示供应商、金额、用途和风险。
Above the auto-pay limit, a central approval card shows the purchase details.

10
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:53,500
价格、地址、预算或安全规则严重异常时，交易会被直接拦截。
Severe price, destination, budget, or safety violations are blocked immediately.

11
00:01:53,500 --> 00:02:10,500
支付后，交易对象、用途、金额、链、代币、审批过程、证明和收据都会写入智能账本。
Every payment, approval, proof, and receipt is written to the smart ledger.

12
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:22,000
名称、别名、分类、项目和备注可以编辑，但原始交易事实不会被篡改。
Accounting labels are editable. Original transaction facts remain immutable.

13
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:34,500
用户可以自然语言询问月度支出、主要类别，或者向某个供应商支付过几次。
Ask naturally about monthly spend, major categories, or any vendor.

14
00:02:34,500 --> 00:02:44,500
供应商支持导入预览、名称编辑、重复检查、部分导入和撤销。
Vendor import supports preview, renaming, duplicate checks, partial import, and undo.

15
00:02:44,500 --> 00:02:55,000
项目已完成 Binance Agentic Wallet 的 BSC-USDT 真实支付验证。
The project has completed a real BSC-USDT payment proof through Binance Agentic Wallet.

16
00:02:55,000 --> 00:03:05,000
钱包负责付款；Agent Treasury 让 AI 的每一笔支出可控制、可解释、可追踪。
Wallets execute payments. Agent Treasury makes every AI expense controllable, explainable, and traceable.
